ttps://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105105","id":2784018098,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6l8L6y","user":{"login":"JekSun97","id":130399274,"node_id":"U_kgDOB8W8Kg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130399274?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97","html_url":"https://github.com/JekSun97","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-07T17:02:11Z","updated_at":"2025-04-07T17:02:11Z","body":"Maybe then it's worth just updating the comments for current information.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2784018098/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2788728060","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105105#issuecomment-2788728060","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105105","id":2788728060,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mOJz8","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-09T08:10:46Z","updated_at":"2025-04-09T08:10:46Z","body":"> Comments are never superfluous. Especially for those who translate them into a language other than English, for example, I have translated several comments, and not always the functions are named as described in the comment.\r\n\r\nI sympathise, but:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4248411baf7a81b49e827f3f17d9dcc4b53b6c6a/servers/navigation_server_2d.h#L65-L66\r\n\r\nA lot of these methods are also exposed, which means they have corresponding descriptions in the class reference.\r\nSo, I don't feel like there's any need add many summaries in the header. If they are necessary to even understand what the methods do, there may be a flaw in how these methods are structured.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2788728060/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2859628304","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105105#issuecomment-2859628304","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/1051